{"sections":[{"slug":"Hesse矩阵","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hesse矩阵"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Hesse <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Hesse 矩阵”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的函数</span> $u$, Hesse <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hess}u := \\nabla^2 u = \\nabla(du)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $T^*M\\otimes T^*M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>,\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u (X,Y)=\\nabla_X(\\nabla u)(Y)=\\nabla_X\\nabla_Y u - \\nabla_{\\nabla_{X}Y}u.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Levi-Civita联络","text":"Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的无挠性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">知</span> Hesse <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵对称</span>:\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u(X,Y)=\\nabla^2 u (Y,X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">使用局部坐标</span>,\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u = (\\partial _i\\partial _j u-\\Gamma_{ij}^k\\partial _k u) dx^i\\otimes dx^j.\r\n$$\nHesse <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵的迹是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Laplace算子","text":"Laplace <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}